cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below.  The cubature rules
  themselves and the method paper are separate records; cite whichever of the
  three you used.
title: PositiveWeightQuadratureSolvers.jl
abstract: >-
  Solvers for interior cubature rules with strictly positive weights for the
  Gaussian weight N(0, I_d) on R^d and the uniform weight on [0,1]^d: the moment
  systems, the symmetry ansaetze (B_d, D_d, S_d x Z_2, S_{d+1} x Z_2,
  icosahedral, rotational and product orbits), free-node and pair elimination,
  the spectral start, the degree ladder, the extended-precision polish, and the
  verification gate.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Pinkse
    given-names: Joris
    email: pinkse@gmail.com
    affiliation: The Pennsylvania State University
repository-code: https://github.com/NittanyLion/PositiveWeightQuadratureSolvers.jl
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-13"
keywords:
  - cubature
  - quadrature
  - positive weights
  - Gauss-Hermite
  - numerical integration
  - Julia
